.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt EVENT_CREATE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm event_create
.Nd create a user-event doorbell
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn event_create flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm returns an initially clear doorbell.  It may be transferred with reduced
SIGNAL rights to another process and registered with an event queue.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
